{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01P2kVoWVGD432Rv5kpX4VqV","type":"tool_result","content":"commit 988e65c1e3ecdc067a12523ab618ede2307e7f15\nAuthor: Alexandre Linhares <alex@linhares.ltd>\nDate:   Thu Oct 1 15:19:53 2026 +0100\n\n    Ralph loop0007 iteration 2: 02 The repaired rules in the C. In `customer_search.c` and\n    \n    Driver: Ralph_Loops/loop0007/loop.py\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n Ralph_Loops/loop0007/PROGRESS.md        |  46 ++++-\n Ralph_Loops/loop0007/iterations.md      |   2 +-\n Ralph_Loops/loop0007/loop.log           |   5 +\n Ralph_Loops/loop0007/nohup.out          |   5 +\n Ralph_Loops/loop0007/session_it02.jsonl | 334 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n Ralph_Loops/loop0007/session_it02.log   | 167 ++++++++++++++++\n Ralph_Loops/loop0007/status.json        |   6 +-\n paper2/data/solver_fix_c_check.json     | 153 +++++++++++++++\n paper2/solver_fix.md                    | 128 +++++++++++-\n paper2/solver_fix_c_check.py            | 238 +++++++++++++++++++++++\n satisfiability/customer_search.c        | 102 +++++++++-\n satisfiability/customer_search.py       |   9 +-\n satisfiability/native.py                |  18 +-\n tests/test_repaired_rules.py            | 149 +++++++++++++-\n 14 files changed, 1331 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)\ncommit 988e65c1e3ecdc067a12523ab618ede2307e7f15\nAuthor: Alexandre Linhares <alex@linhares.ltd>\nDate:   Thu Oct 1 15:19:53 2026 +0100\n\n    Ralph loop0007 iteration 2: 02 The repaired rules in the C. In `customer_search.c` and\n    \n    Driver: Ralph_Loops/loop0007/loop.py\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\ndiff --git a/satisfiability/customer_search.c b/satisfiability/customer_search.c\nindex ae3f2edf9..33894dc2a 100644\n--- a/satisfiability/customer_search.c\n+++ b/satisfiability/customer_search.c\n@@ -116,6 +116,7 @@ typedef struct {\n     int      better_move_dominators;   /* how many q to try;